rules_text = "Two dice. Pass Line: 7 or 11 on the come-out wins, 2, 3 or 12 loses, anything else is the point; then hit the point before a 7. Don't Pass is the other side (12 pushes). Field and Any Seven are one-roll bets. The shooter throws with SHOOT."
